== Description ==

MacroToolbarManager makes it easy to edit custom macro toolbars.

Full documentation can be found on github: [https://github.com/mwganson/MacroToolbarManager MacroToolbarManager]. Note: latest version requires recent version of FreeCAD. If it doesn't work, try the 2023.10.27 version available at the above github link.

Forum discussion page for this macro: [https://forum.freecad.org/viewtopic.php?t=81878 Forum]

